                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00097         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00098         *          2002/04/04  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00099         * Consolidated Level 2/Level 2 V3 os9defs.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00100         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00101         *          2002/04/30  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00102         * Added NitrOS-9 definitions.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00103         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00104         *          2003/05/30  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00105         * Added WD1002 sys vars to Level One section.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00106         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00107         *          2003/06/02  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00108         * Fixed incorrectly ordered D.X*** system globals for OS-9 Level One and
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00109         * changed the sizes from 2 to 3 bytes.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00110         * DT.NFM is now the same for both Level One and Level Two.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00111         * Added DT.CDFM type for future CD-ROM file manager
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00112         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00113         *          2003/11/05  Robert Gault
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00114         * Fixed MouseInf. Made it rmb 2 as it should be. Also changes to init and cc3io.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00115         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00116         *              2005/11/02  P.Harvey-Smith
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00117         * Added definitions for boot areas on Dragon computers.
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00118         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00119         *              2006/03/03  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00120         * Added F$Debug and D.DbgMem areas, common to all levels of NitrOS-9
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00121         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00122         *        2019/10/30  Bill Nobel, from discussions with L. Curtis Boyle
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00123         * Added I$ModDsc call (modify device descriptor in system memory) BN/LCB
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00124         *
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00125         *        2019/12/27 L. Curtis Boyle
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00126         * Added D.IRQTmp for faster temp vars (currently used in Krn F$Move/6809,
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00127         *   can be used elsewheres later, in small routines with IRQ's turned off).
                      (/../../defs/os9.d):00128         *
