                      (../../defs/coco.d):00062         * Clock Speed Type Definitions
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00063         *
     0001             (../../defs/coco.d):00064         OneMHz              EQU       1
     0002             (../../defs/coco.d):00065         TwoMHz              EQU       2
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00066                             IFEQ      CPUType-Color
0040                  (../../defs/coco.d):00067         CPUSpeed            SET       OneMHz
                      (../../defs/coco.d):00068                             ELSE
     0002             (../../defs/coco.d):00069         CPUSpeed            SET       TwoMHz
